WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.309 --> 00:00:11.710
Hey youtubers it’s charlie, I hope you guys
have all had an awesome holiday week.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:16.250
I’ve been doing so many wholock videos I
didn’t want to let New Year’s creep by

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.210
without inviting the Walkers.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:23.050
So we just got news that there will be another
major character death in the second half of

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:26.320
walking dead season 4 so I thought it would
be fun to try and guess who it’s going to

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:27.320
be.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:31.990
To be clear, this isn’t coming right away
and it’s going to be very hard to top the

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:36.239
two major character deaths from the midseason
finale but it does help us narrow the list.

00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:40.580
And a big heads up, if you’ve seen my Game
of Thrones kill list video, I’ll be doing

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.580
the same game for Walking Dead when it comes
back.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.940
I’ll do a video explaining it before the
show comes back, but basically we just try

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:45.950
and guess who’s going to die first in each
episode.

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:47.400
And I give the winner a prize.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:52.100
I haven’t decided what they’re going to
be yet, but be sure to subscribe if you’re

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.199
not already to participate.

00:00:53.199 --> 00:00:55.189
Careful for spoilers for the comic books.

00:00:55.189 --> 00:00:57.460
In order to talk about deaths we’ll have
to reference the comics because it’s become

00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:00.670
like a game of thrones situation where the
tv story changes the book story.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:05.409
So here’s my top 5 pieces of evidence about
who this WTF death is going to be.

00:01:05.409 --> 00:01:07.189
Number 1 - Who’s safe?

00:01:07.189 --> 00:01:09.630
Let’s talk about who it’s not going to
be first.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.409
And that is Daryl.

00:01:11.409 --> 00:01:13.280
Everyone breath a sigh of relief.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:16.670
Norman Reedus already started talking about
how excited he was to get back and start filming

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:17.830
season 5.

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:18.830
Meaning he is returning.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:20.564
In my mind, other than one or two other people
he would be the biggest character the show

00:01:20.564 --> 00:01:21.564
could still kill.

00:01:21.564 --> 00:01:22.850
Number 2 - Biggest person who was not in the
comics.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:32.909
The biggest character who is not in the books
is Beth.

00:01:32.909 --> 00:01:35.179
Number 3 - Who was feeding the rats.

00:01:35.179 --> 00:01:40.250
We’re going to find out who was feeding
the rats.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:45.340
The best theory I’ve seen is that it was
Lizzie.

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.799
Tyreese theorized that the same person who
was feeding the rats killed Karen and David.

00:01:49.799 --> 00:01:52.649
That doesn’t mean lizzie will die, but here’s
where Carol comes back.

00:01:52.649 --> 00:01:55.330
Number 4 - Carol Vs Tyreese.

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:58.770
Carol is coming back, we don’t know which
episode, but we do know that she’ll meet

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:00.200
up with Tyreese’s group.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.920
Remember he ran off into the woods with Lizzie
and her friends.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:04.939
And mostly likely baby Judith too.

00:02:04.939 --> 00:02:09.030
We know that no one ever told tyreese about
carol confessing to killing karen and david.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:11.670
But what if carol was just covering for lizzie.

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:15.160
What would tyreese do if he discovered the
truth and it turned out to be lizzie.

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:16.740
He probably wouldn’t kill her.

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.280
But he would try to banish her.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.330
And carol would do anything to save lizzie.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:23.700
Like killing tyreese to prevent him from hurting
her or sending her away.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.750
Number 5 - It’s someone who’s still alive
in the comic books.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.390
It’s an unconfirmed rumor but The biggest
characters on the show that are still alive

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:34.780
in the comics are Rick, Carl, Maggie and Michonne.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:42.060
Of all those people the most heartbreaking
death I could imagine would be maggie.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:45.450
Lauren Cohan wasn’t spotted on set when
they were shooting the second half of the

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.349
coming episodes this season.

00:02:47.349 --> 00:02:50.760
And she hasn’t been very active on twitter,
which for her is unusual.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:55.310
All these signs point to her dying or going
on a long trip off camera somewhere around

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:56.860
episode 12 or 13.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:01.240
And the whole business with the rats, lizzie,
tyreese and carol could be misdirection for

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:04.320
the death of someone unexpected.

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:09.140
So based on the evidence here’s my list
in order from most likely to die to least

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:10.140
likely.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:15.030
Maggie, Tyreese, Lizzie, Carol, Michonne,
Rick and Carl.

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:20.480
Let me know whether or not you think Maggie
will be the next big WTF death or if you think

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:21.730
it will be someone else.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:26.379
There are a couple shows starting next week
including Sherlock Season 3, Community Season

00:03:26.379 --> 00:03:29.390
5 and my anime club show.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:32.659
So once we get past that I’ll post a video
explaining how my walking dead game is going

00:03:32.659 --> 00:03:33.659
to work.

00:03:33.659 --> 00:03:34.980
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:38.760
I’m giving away one more twenty dollar amazon
giftcard to a random subscriber from the comments

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:41.150
even though this isn’t technically a wholock
week video.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:44.879
Don’t worry though, if you haven’t won
anything yet, I’ll be doing weekly giveaways

00:03:44.879 --> 00:03:47.390
